{
  "description": "The pack a download requests and where it turns on each answer. A device with a base, the bundle it runs, requests a delta pack whenever a file is missing, one included: the delta the envelope lists for its base, else the pack at {filesBaseUrl}/apps/{appId}/bundles/{bundleId}/deltas/{baseBundleId}; on a 404 it asks the updates host at {updatesBaseUrl}/v1/apps/{appId}/bundles/{bundleId}/deltas/{baseBundleId}, and anything else that host answers, its redirect to the full pack above twenty objects included, sends it to the full pack. A device without a base requests the full pack. No redirect is followed. Any other error of a delta pack on the files host or of the full pack fails the download with DOWNLOAD_FAILED, retried next cycle. statuses are the answers to the requests in order, requests the packs requested, packKind the kind of the pack that served the download, files when no file was missing and null when the download failed.",
